1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,611
In the shoot, the extra auxin speeds up growth on the lower side, so the shoot curves up.

2
00:00:05,611 --> 00:00:11,692
In the root the same concentration inhibits growth, because roots are far more sensitive.

3
00:00:11,692 --> 00:00:15,195
The lower side grows less, and the root curves down.

4
00:00:15,195 --> 00:00:18,906
Same hormone, same side, opposite results.

